summary:
  A config from before the Accent list existed loses its system accent.

history:
  followSystemAccent was the only colour setting until the list of three
  came, and a config written then holds a yes there under accentMode 0.
  The player has read that as the system accent ever since; 2026.44 moved
  the reading into ColorLogic.accentMode so the Appearance page shows the
  same answer. Dropping the old key there would turn every such listener's
  widget green at the next start.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ColorLogic.js

find:
      return followSystem === true ? 1 : 0;

replace:
      return 0;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_colorlogic.qml::test_every_pair_of_the_two_keys_reads_as_one_mode
  and tests/qml/tst_appearancepage.qml::test_the_list_shows_what_the_player_wears.
  Line-neutral.
